{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_40425","headline":"吊贾岛二首 二 · 曹松","name":"吊贾岛二首 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"青斾低寒水，清笳出晓风。\n鸟来伤贾傅，马立葬滕公。\n松柏青山上，城池白日中。\n一朝今古隔，惟有月明同。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"曹松","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_40425.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_40425","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}